"""Builds The Kodr training dataset.

Produces dataset/kodr-dataset.jsonl - a chat-format (system/user/assistant)
curriculum for training a universal game-generation model. Every answer is a
concrete, correct, copy-pasteable artifact: an engine script, a system, or a
complete map definition in the universal kodr-map-v1 schema.

Engines covered: Roblox (Luau), Unity (C#), Godot (GDScript), Unreal (C++).
"""
